<title>USA: Cygne may pay $2.1 mln to settle suit.</title>
<headline>Cygne may pay $2.1 mln to settle suit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cygne Designs Inc said Tuesday it has tentatively settled a shareholder class action filed against it in 1995.</p>
<p>The company said it would contribute about $2.1 million to a settlement of about $5.75 million, with the balance coming from insurance and other parties in the litigation.</p>
<p>Cygne said the settlement is subject to judicial approval.</p>
